Task 2 — Order of Conditions

A customer is 6 years old and qualifies for a disability discount. The regular ticket price is $12.What should the final ticket price be?
What would happen if the disability discount condition appeared before the age condition in an if-elif-else structure?
Explain why the order of conditions matters.
